          "text": "Description: On April 8, 1996, a witness in a car observed for a few moments a ball of fire with a trail falling towards the ground. The phenomenon was silent and the ball suddenly went out, turning dark red. The witness's description corresponds to the observation of an atmospheric reentry.",
